			"width": 800,
			"height": 170,
			"text": "## Risk register (form input)\n\n- *Risk # | Description | Probability | Impact | Tags | Actions*\n- R-101 | Steel supplier delivers late | High | Major | supply, vendor | Expedite PO; qualify second supplier\n- R-102 | Lead engineer leaves mid-project | Medium | Moderate | people | Cross-train; document handover",
